{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AWaV7Rv46GFTS2CBypsfWz","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"5296\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"56\" y=\"56\" width=\"1288\" height=\"185\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"STOCKWAVE · LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"StockWave — stock trading app\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1288\" height=\"60\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design the complete StockWave mobile app: Agatha Bella signs up, verifies her phone, lands on a home screen with her portfolio, indices, wishlist and stocks, reviews her portfolio, opens Netflix (NFLX), buys 3 shares and manages her profile. Canvas 375 × 812 (iPhone), light mode only. Frozen demo data, not live quotes. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"104\" width=\"1288\" height=\"81\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"56\" y=\"289\" width=\"1288\" height=\"268\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 12 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, error, disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the StockWave logo, company logos, illustrations and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"216\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"56\" y=\"605\" width=\"1288\" height=\"2436\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"2345\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"225\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Brand: StockWave_Symbol · StockWave_Wordmark\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"153\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ auto → 02_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"180\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Onboarding\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"330\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Introduce StockWave and start sign-up or sign-in.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Actions: Skip · Sign in · Sign up • Copy: “Stock trading suite” · “Streamline your investment decisions with expert guidance.” • Media: the app shown on a phone (Blank_Phone_Frame) • Pages: 2 onboarding pages · current: 1\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ Sign up → 03_Sign_Up_Empty → Skip → 03_Sign_Up_Empty\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Sign_Up (Empty / Filled)\" x=\"0\" y=\"362\" width=\"628\" height=\"388\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Sign_Up (Empty / Filled)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: Create an account with minimum effort.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Actions: Continue · Continue with Google · Continue with Apple · “Already have an account?” Sign In • Copy: “Join StockWave” · “Embark on your investment journey with a single dollar.” · “Or continue with” • Form: Email · Password · Username\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"STATES (ONE FRAME EACH)\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"• 03_Sign_Up_Empty — nothing entered • 03_Sign_Up_Filled — Agatha Bella · agbella@email.com · password entered (masked)\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n          <text id=\"4:35\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"316\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"→ Continue (Filled) → 04_Verify_Phone\" x=\"24\" y=\"343\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:37\" name=\"04_Verify_Phone\" x=\"660\" y=\"362\" width=\"628\" height=\"330\">\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"04_Verify_Phone\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"Goal: Enter a phone number to receive a code.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"• Actions: back · Send code • Copy: “Enter your phone number” · “You’ll receive a 4 digit code for the phone number verification” • Number pad: 1–9, *, 0, delete • Phone: +1 202 555 0147 entered\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"4:42\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"→ back → 03_Sign_Up_Filled → Send code → 05_Verify_Code\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:44\" name=\"05_Verify_Code\" x=\"0\" y=\"782\" width=\"628\" height=\"330\">\n          <text id=\"4:45\" name=\"05_Verify_Code\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"Goal: Confirm the phone with a 4-digit code.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:48\" name=\"• Actions: back · Resend code · Verify account • Code: 4 digits · first digit entered: 2 • Copy: “Enter verification code” · “We have sent a verification code to your mobile number” • Number pad: 1–9, *, 0, delete\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"4:49\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"→ back → 04_Verify_Phone → Verify account → 06_Welcome\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:51\" name=\"06_Welcome\" x=\"660\" y=\"782\" width=\"628\" height=\"267\">\n          <text id=\"4:52\" name=\"06_Welcome\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"Goal: Greet the new investor.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:55\" name=\"• Actions: “I’m ready to start!” • Copy: “Hello Agatha Bella!” · “Welcome to StockWave” · “It’s great to have you here” • Media: Welcome_Hand\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n          <text id=\"4:56\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"195\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"→ I’m ready to start! → 07_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"222\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:58\" name=\"07_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"1144\" width=\"628\" height=\"435\">\n          <text id=\"4:59\" name=\"07_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"Goal: See portfolio value, markets and watched stocks at a glance.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:61\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:62\" name=\"• Account: notifications entry • Brand: StockWave_Wordmark • Indices: S&amp;P 500 (S&amp;P · Standard &amp; Poor’s) +49.50% · Dow Jones (DOW) +1.43% • Main navigation: current tab Home • Portfolio: “Portfolio value” $13,240.11 · show / hide value · 7-day trend line • Stocks: “Stocks” · 5 — NFLX · AAPL · FB · BAC · F — each with logo, ticker, company, price, daily change and trend line • Wishlist: “Wishlist” · add · 3 — AMZN · ADBE · FB — each with logo, ticker, company, daily change and trend line\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"189\" />\n          <text id=\"4:63\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"321\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:64\" name=\"→ Portfolio value → 08_Portfolio → NFLX → 09_Stock_Detail → tabs → 07 / 08 / 10 / 11\" x=\"24\" y=\"348\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:65\" name=\"08_Portfolio\" x=\"660\" y=\"1144\" width=\"628\" height=\"435\">\n          <text id=\"4:66\" name=\"08_Portfolio\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:67\" name=\"Goal: Understand portfolio value and today’s gain and loss.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:68\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:69\" name=\"• Actions: back • Chart: portfolio value per day Mon–Sun (values in Fixed data) · highlighted: Sun $13,240.11 • Copy: “Portfolio” • Main navigation: current tab Portfolio • Portfolio: “Portfolio value” $13,240.11 · +1.53% today • Stocks: “Stocks” · NFLX · AAPL — each with logo, ticker, company, price, daily change and trend line • Today: Gain $234.11 · Loss $34.11\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"189\" />\n          <text id=\"4:70\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"321\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"→ back → 07_Home → NFLX → 09_Stock_Detail → tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"348\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:72\" name=\"09_Stock_Detail\" x=\"0\" y=\"1611\" width=\"628\" height=\"393\">\n          <text id=\"4:73\" name=\"09_Stock_Detail\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:74\" name=\"Goal: Check one stock and start buying.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:75\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:76\" name=\"• Actions: back · price alert entry · Buy stocks • Chart: NFLX price over the current range · highlighted point Sep 27 · $88.04 • Copy: “Stock Detail” • Financials: “Financials” · Revenue / Earnings / Performance · years 2018–2021 • Price: $88.91 · +$1.13 (+1.29%) today • Range: 1D / 1W / 1M / 1Y / 5Y / ALL · current: 1M • Stock: Logo_Netflix · NFLX · Netflix, Inc • View: Summary / Details · current: Details\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"168\" />\n          <text id=\"4:77\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"300\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:78\" name=\"→ back → 07_Home → Buy stocks → 10_Confirm_Order\" x=\"24\" y=\"327\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:79\" name=\"10_Confirm_Order\" x=\"660\" y=\"1611\" width=\"628\" height=\"372\">\n          <text id=\"4:80\" name=\"10_Confirm_Order\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:81\" name=\"Goal: Review a buy order and choose how to pay.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:82\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:83\" name=\"• Actions: back · Confirm order • Copy: “Confirm Order” • Order: NFLX · Netflix, Inc · $88.91 · Funding source “Stockup” · Approx share price $88.91 · Approx shares 3 · Fee $2.10 · Total $268.83 • Payment method: “Payment method” · Debit Card “Deposit &amp; Invest right from your debit card” (Icon_Card) · Apple Pay “Connect your Apple Pay account” (Icon_Apple_Pay) · only one can be chosen · none chosen yet\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n          <text id=\"4:84\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"279\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:85\" name=\"→ back → 09_Stock_Detail → Confirm order → 07_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"306\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:86\" name=\"11_Profile\" x=\"0\" y=\"2036\" width=\"628\" height=\"309\">\n          <text id=\"4:87\" name=\"11_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:88\" name=\"Goal: Identify the account and reach settings.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:89\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:90\" name=\"• Account: Avatar_Neutral · Agatha Bella · agbella@email.com • Copy: “Profile” • Entries: Account · Billing / Payments · FAQ · Language (English) · Security · Settings • Invite: “Invite friends” · “Invite your friends and get $15” • Main navigation: current tab Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"4:91\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:92\" name=\"→ tabs\" x=\"24\" y=\"264\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:93\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"56\" y=\"3089\" width=\"1288\" height=\"220\">\n      <text id=\"4:94\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:95\" name=\"• Onboarding: 01_Splash → 02_Onboarding → 03_Sign_Up_Empty → 03_Sign_Up_Filled → 04_Verify_Phone → 05_Verify_Code → 06_Welcome → 07_Home. • Main navigation on 07, 08, 11 — five tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home) → 07 · Portfolio (Icon_Portfolio) → 08 · Trade (Icon_Trade) → 10 · Market (Icon_Market, entry only) · Profile (Icon_Profile) → 11. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours. • Pushed screens with back: 04, 05, 08, 09, 10. 09 and 10 have no main navigation. • Entry only (no screen required): Sign in, social sign-up, Resend code, notifications, show / hide value, Wishlist add, price alert, Summary / Financials tabs, ranges, Stockup, Market tab, profile entries, Invite friends. • There is no sign-in, biometrics, PIN, password-reset or order-result screen — do not add frames beyond the 12.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"168\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:96\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"56\" y=\"3357\" width=\"1288\" height=\"1207\">\n      <text id=\"4:97\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:98\" name=\"Use these values verbatim. “+” = up / gain, “−” = down / loss.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:99\" name=\"Data cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"1116\">\n        <frame id=\"4:100\" name=\"User\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"122\">\n          <text id=\"4:101\" name=\"User\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:102\" name=\"Agatha Bella · agbella@email.com · +1 202 555 0147 · avatar = Avatar_Neutral Language English · currency USD · amounts with two decimals\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"42\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:103\" name=\"Stocks (ticker · company · price · daily change · logo)\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"185\">\n          <text id=\"4:104\" name=\"Stocks (ticker · company · price · daily change · logo)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:105\" name=\"NFLX · Netflix, Inc · $88.91 · +1.29% · Logo_Netflix AAPL · Apple, Inc · $142.65 · +0.81% · Logo_Apple FB · Facebook, Inc · $343.01 · +1.07% · Logo_Facebook BAC · Bank of America · $43.08 · +0.30% · Logo_Bank_of_America F · Ford Motor · $14.06 · −0.32% · no logo supplied\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:106\" name=\"Wishlist &amp; indices\" x=\"0\" y=\"217\" width=\"628\" height=\"143\">\n          <text id=\"4:107\" name=\"Wishlist &amp; indices\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:108\" name=\"Wishlist: AMZN · Amazon, Inc · −0.05% · Logo_Amazon / ADBE · Adobe, Inc · +0.32% · Logo_Adobe / FB · Facebook, Inc · +1.07% Indices: S&amp;P 500 (S&amp;P, Standard &amp; Poor’s) +49.50% · Dow Jones (DOW) +1.43%\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"63\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:109\" name=\"Portfolio\" x=\"660\" y=\"217\" width=\"628\" height=\"185\">\n          <text id=\"4:110\" name=\"Portfolio\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:111\" name=\"Portfolio value $13,240.11 · +1.53% today Today: Gain $234.11 · Loss $34.11 Per day: Mon $12,240.11 · Tue $12,880.00 · Wed $12,460.00 · Thu $12,930.00 · Fri $13,160.00 · Sat $13,040.11 · Sun $13,240.11 Holdings shown: NFLX, AAPL\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:112\" name=\"Stock detail (NFLX)\" x=\"0\" y=\"434\" width=\"628\" height=\"164\">\n          <text id=\"4:113\" name=\"Stock detail (NFLX)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:114\" name=\"$88.91 · +$1.13 (+1.29%) today · previous close $87.78 Range 1D 1W 1M 1Y 5Y ALL · current 1M · highlighted Sep 27 · $88.04 View Summary / Details · current Details Financials: Revenue / Earnings / Performance · 2018 2019 2020 2021\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"84\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:115\" name=\"Order\" x=\"660\" y=\"434\" width=\"628\" height=\"185\">\n          <text id=\"4:116\" name=\"Order\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:117\" name=\"Buy NFLX · Netflix, Inc · $88.91 Funding source “Stockup” Approx share price $88.91 · Approx shares 3 · Fee $2.10 Total $268.83 (= 3 × $88.91 + $2.10) Payment method: Debit Card · Apple Pay — none chosen yet\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:118\" name=\"Sign up &amp; verification\" x=\"0\" y=\"651\" width=\"628\" height=\"227\">\n          <text id=\"4:119\" name=\"Sign up &amp; verification\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:120\" name=\"“Join StockWave” · “Embark on your investment journey with a single dollar.” Username · Email · Password · Continue · “Or continue with” · Continue with Google · Continue with Apple · “Already have an account? Sign In” Phone: “Enter your phone number” · “You’ll receive a 4 digit code for the phone number verification” · Send code Code: “Enter verification code” · “We have sent a verification code to your mobile number” · Resend code · Verify account\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:121\" name=\"Onboarding, welcome &amp; profile\" x=\"660\" y=\"651\" width=\"628\" height=\"206\">\n          <text id=\"4:122\" name=\"Onboarding, welcome &amp; profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:123\" name=\"Onboarding: “Stock trading suite” · “Streamline your investment decisions with expert guidance.” · Skip · Sign in · Sign up Welcome: “Hello Agatha Bella!” · “Welcome to StockWave” · “It’s great to have you here” · “I’m ready to start!” Profile: Account · Security · Billing / Payments · Language: English · Settings · FAQ · Invite friends “Invite your friends and get $15”\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"126\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:124\" name=\"Source corrections\" x=\"0\" y=\"910\" width=\"628\" height=\"206\">\n          <text id=\"4:125\" name=\"Source corrections\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:126\" name=\"The source mixes the brand names Stockline / StockWave and the emails agbella@email.com / agbella@gmail.com, shows Bank of America prices on the Netflix detail, an order total that ignores share count and fee ($141.65, “$3.00” shares), a chart point ($29,140) and a daily return (+1.74%) that contradict the portfolio value and today’s $200.00 net gain, decimal commas and typos (“suit”, “Sent code”). Follow this brief, not the source.\" x=\"24\" y=\"56\" width=\"580\" height=\"126\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:127\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"56\" y=\"4612\" width=\"1288\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"4:128\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:129\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"229\">\n        <frame id=\"4:130\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"229\">\n          <text id=\"4:131\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:132\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color + Inter • Media: StockWave logo, company logos, illustrations, icons, neutral avatar • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"580\" height=\"147\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:133\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"208\">\n          <text id=\"4:134\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"24\" />\n          <text id=\"4:135\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, semantic and chart colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, pressed, disabled, filled, hidden value, chosen / not chosen • Headers, main navigation, number pad and all business components • Chart styling (trend lines, portfolio chart, price chart, financial bars)\" x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"580\" height=\"126\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:136\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"56\" y=\"4941\" width=\"1288\" height=\"299\">\n      <text id=\"4:137\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:138\" name=\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <text id=\"4:139\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tabs and ranges, empty vs filled form, partial code, gain vs loss, unchosen payment method)\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"168\" />\n      <text id=\"4:140\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 12 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"275\" width=\"1288\" height=\"24\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"ba866434-1d43-491c-b148-4054d5758d9f","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:18:08.139Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"5296\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"56\" y=\"56\" width=\"1288\" height=\"185\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"STOCKWAVE · LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"20\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"StockWave — stock trading app\" x=\"0\" y=\"32\" width=\"1288\" height=\"60\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design the complete StockWave mobile app: Agatha Bella signs up, verifies her phone, lands on a home screen with her portfolio, indices, wishlist and stocks, reviews her portfolio, opens Netflix (NFLX), buys 3 shares and manages her profile. Canvas 375 × 812 (iPhone), light mode only. Frozen demo data, not live quotes. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"104\" width=\"1288\" height=\"81\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"56\" y=\"289\" width=\"1288\" height=\"268\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 12 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, gain / loss, error, disabled, chart colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the StockWave logo, company logos, illustrations and icons from 04 · Media. People have no photos: use Avatar_Neutral. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"216\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"56\" y=\"605\" width=\"1288\" height=\"2436\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1288\" height=\"36\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"52\" width=\"1288\" height=\"23\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"91\" width=\"1288\" height=\"2345\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"225\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Splash\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: Brand recognition while the app loads.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Brand: StockWave_Symbol · StockWave_Wordmark\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"153\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ auto → 02_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"180\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_Onboarding\" x=\"660\" y=\"0\" width=\"628\" height=\"330\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_Onboarding\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"580\" height=\"30\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Introduce StockWave and start sign-up or sign-in.\" x=\"24\" y=\"64\" width=\"580\" height=\"21\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"95\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Actions: Skip · Sign in · Sign up • Copy: “Stock trading suite” · “Streamline your investment decisions with expert guidance.” • Media: the app shown on a phone (Blank_Phone_Frame) • Pages: 2 onboarding pages · current: 1\" x=\"24\" y=\"122\" width=\"580\" height=\"105\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"237\" width=\"580\" height=\"17\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ Sign up → 03_Sign_Up_Empty → Skip → 03_Sign_Up_Empty\" x