{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJvHjajQDRGTd9CnRCr4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to carry out the build planning and setup for the StockWave mobile app design, working through the tokens, component library, and screen frames. Let me work through the design system setup and the component construction.\n\nI set the workspace page as current and load Inter in Regular, Medium, Semi Bold, and Bold. I define the token palette: brand #3E52C1, brandDark #25307A, brandSoft #EEF0FB, bg #F7F8FC, card #FFFFFF, text #14162E, sub #6E7385, muted #9BA0B3, border #E4E6EE, gain #12B76A, loss #F04438 (I keep the loss red as #F04438 from the notes), disabled #C3C8DE. I build a helper for solid fills and a text helper that sets name, font, characters, size, color, optional letter spacing and line height, then resizes to a fixed width with height auto-resize.\n\nI lay out 12 frames at 375×812: 01_Splash, 02_Onboarding, 03_Sign_Up_Empty, 03_Sign_Up_Filled, 04_Verify_Phone, 05_Verify_Code, 06_Welcome, 07_Home, 08_Portfolio, 09_Stock_Detail, 10_Confirm_Order, 11_Profile — that is the list I hold, and I place them in a grid with 440 step in x.\n\nFor components I build at y=9200: a Button set with Primary, Secondary, Disabled, Ghost at 327×52, radius 12, Inter Semi Bold 16; a TextField set at 327×52 with Empty, Filled, Focused states (border 1, #9BA0B3 placeholder); a TabBar at 375×84 with 5 tabs and per-tab active variants; a ScreenHeader at 375×56 with a chevron back; a Keypad (1-9, *, 0, delete); a StockRow at 343×72 with a 40 logo tile, ticker, company, a 52×24 sparkline, and price/change; and Spark up/down variants. I use createNodeFromSvg for the chevron and sparklines, and a tint helper that walks instance children setting strokes and fills.\n\nThe three long screens — 07_Home, 08_Portfolio, 09_Stock_Detail — I size taller than 812 so the full content is inspectable, since the canvas notes allow vertical scroll on those. Home content totals roughly 1200px: header 60, portfolio card 200, indices 100, five stock rows about 460, wishlist rows about 250, tab bar 84.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6428,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":28872,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6428}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"e65a7dca-1797-40e4-87c0-9e06b871a3f1","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:20:06.781Z","thinking_duration_ms":69865}
