e financials card 343x180 at 16,676 with bars 40/55/70/95 and 20/28/36/50, and the buy button at 24,880.\n\nText inside a component instance cannot be edited, so each ticker gets its own row and wishlist component carrying fixed content, and the home rows are composed as frames at 343x72 with a 44px logo tile at 0,14, ticker text at 56,16, company at 56,38, and a spark instance at 176,24. The white eye on the brand card is drawn as inline SVG rather than a tinted instance. For 10_Confirm_Order at 812 height I use the stock card 343x84 at 16,110, funding card at 16,232, summary 343x172 at 16,316 (share price $88.91, 3 shares, fee $2.10, total $268.83), payment options 343x76 at 16,528 and 16,616, and the confirm button at 24,712. For 11_Profile at 812 height the avatar sits at 24,116, the invite card 343x88 at 16,216, and a 6-row entries card 343x336 at 16,320, with the tab bar at 728. All of this is independent, so I issue the three build calls together: one rebuilding splash, onboarding, and both sign-ups; one building Home, Portfolio, and Stock Detail; one building Confirm Order and Profile.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":10448,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":71506,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10448}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"a1121c23-4657-450f-aac9-f7e01ae35607","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:26:54.057Z","thinking_duration_ms":73855}
