{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwAXulD0mIryt0l4VhI","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to inspect the sign-up and verify screens and fix the wrapping placeholder and label text. The 03_Sign_Up fields break \"Username\" and \"Password\" because the Text Field instance text resizes with a narrow width; the master component 7:20 children need a text width around 280 with textAutoResize HEIGHT. The buttons wrap \"Send code\", \"I'm ready to start!\" and \"Verify account\", so the master button label needs width auto or an explicit width of 200. On 06_Welcome a white \"StockWave\" overlaps the title, and node 10:480 needs checking for stray text. The dark phone frame looks acceptable, though a white rounded rect and symbol inside would read better. Fix the component texts before re-screenshotting the remaining 5 screens.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6784,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":108679,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6784}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"7ed7199e-5ec7-4154-8678-8c92240a7a2d","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:30:19.915Z","thinking_duration_ms":13930}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwAXulD0mIryt0l4VhI","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Next I need three things: the remaining five screens looked at, the component-level text wrapping fixed, and whatever stray text is overlapping the Welcome title identified. Fixing the Button and Text Field masters also repairs the screens I haven't rendered yet, so the fix and the five screenshots are independent calls and go together now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6784,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":108679,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6784}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"1dd3d9d6-bead-4012-b0c3-bfdf212d6154","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:30:21.923Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwAXulD0mIryt0l4VhI","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ACeXrcM8YMxDj4aos54Pr2","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.indexOf('03')===0); await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:'Semi Bold'});\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:'Regular'});\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:'Medium'});\n// fix Button label wrapping: give label room and no wrap\nconst btn=figma.getNodeById('7:11');\nfor (const v of btn.children){\n  v.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT').forEach(t=>{\n    t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';\n    t.layoutSizingHorizontal='HUG';\n    t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS', value:20};\n  });\n}\n// fix Text Field placeholder wrapping\nconst fld=figma.getNodeById('7:20');\nfor (const v of fld.children){\n  v.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT').forEach(t=>{\n    t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';\n    t.layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL';\n    t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS', value:20};\n  });\n}\n// fix keypad digit centering (labels were centered by manual x maths; verify)\nconst kp=figma.getNodeById('7:28');\nconst kpInfo = kp.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT').map(t=>({chars:t.characters, x:Math.round(t.x), w:Math.round(t.width)}));\n// inspect welcome for stray overlapping text\nconst wl=figma.getNodeById('10:480');\nconst stray = wl.children.map(c=>({name:c.name, type:c.type, x:Math.round(c.x), y:Math.round(c.y), w:Math.round(c.width), h:Math.round(c.height), chars: c.type==='TEXT'?c.characters:undefined}));\nreturn {kpInfo, stray};","description":"Fix button and text field label wrapping and inspect Welcome overlap","fileKey":"qeLSUsUZzxgdj23JDXIOJ0"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6784,"input_tokens":55,"ca