{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwF99WoRlidplqwnNVR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a fix pass on the StockWave screens and the prototype wiring, done as one response since the two calls touch independent things: the visual edits change text and layout nodes, while the wiring only sets reactions on frames that already exist. In the fix pass I correct the wrapped field labels and button labels in the sign-up and verify screens, rework the 06_Welcome title so it sits in two lines at 28px with body and badge pushed down, and shift the 08_Portfolio title to x=68 so it clears the back button at 16,54. In the same response I wire the flow: 01_Splash goes to 02_Onboarding after a timeout, 02_Onboarding to 03_Sign_Up_Empty, 03 to 04_Verify_Phone, 04 to 05_Verify_Code, 05 to 06_Welcome, 06 to 07_Home, then the portfolio card and NFLX rows into 08 and 09, back and Buy stocks into 10, Confirm order back to 07, and the tabs to 07, 08, 10 and 11. I set 01_Splash as the flow starting point and use a dissolve transition of 0.3s. Screenshots come after the fixes land, which is the one thing that genuinely has to wait.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7550,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":115463,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7550}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"0e41b1fb-f278-4be6-ba33-d9b02ba2b21a","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:31:33.338Z","thinking_duration_ms":30691}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwF99WoRlidplqwnNVR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before writing the reply, here's my private list of what's still needed: fix the broken text wrapping on buttons and fields at component level, fix the overlapping Portfolio title and Welcome layout, re-verify those screens, and wire the prototype. The prototype wiring only depends on frames that already exist, and the visual fixes touch different nodes, so both go out in this response; screenshots come after the fixes."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7550,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":115463,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7550}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"00a32ffe-2199-4eb7-87f5-3b4e8ff87fa7","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:31:37.220Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwF99WoRlidplqwnNVR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015LqfmrCc5jL8kTtfAC7ATF","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.indexOf('03')===0); await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nfor(const s of ['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter',style:s});\n\n// ---- global fix: every text inside Button / Text Field instances should hug, never wrap ----\nlet fixed=0;\nfor(const f of ws.children){\n  if(f.type!=='FRAME') continue;\n  f.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE' && (n.name==='C/Button'||n.name==='C/TextField'||n.name==='Button'||n.name==='Text Field')).forEach(inst=>{\n    inst.findAll(t=>t.type==='TEXT').forEach(t=>{\n      t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';\n      t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:20};\n      fixed++;\n    });\n  });\n}\n// masters as well\n['7:11','7:20'].forEach(id=>{ figma.getNodeById(id).findAll(t=>t.type==='TEXT').forEach(t=>{ t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT'; t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:20}; }); });\n\n// ---- fix 06_Welcome title/body/badge collision ----\nconst wl=figma.getNodeById('10:480');\nconst wt=wl.children.find(c=>c.name==='Welcome');\nwt.fontSize=28; wt.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:36}; wt.characters='Welcome to StockWave'; wt.resize(327,36);\nconst wb=wl.children.find(c=>c.name==='Body'); wb.y=462;\nconst hi=wl.children.find(c=>c.name==='Hello'); hi.y=392;\nconst badge=wl.children.find(c=>c.name==='Badge'); badge.y=512;\n\n// ---- fix 08_Portfolio: title hidden behind back button ----\nconst P=figma.getNodeById('11:674');\nconst pTitle=P.children.find(c=>c.name==='Title');\nif(pTitle){ pTitle.x=68; pTitle.y=64; }\n\n// ---- fix 09_Stock_Detail: 'Financials' heading spacing (was tight under tab row) ----\nconst D=figma.getNodeById('11:796');\nreturn {fixed, wlTitle:{x:wt.x,y:wt.y,w:wt.width,h:wt.height}, pTitle:{x:pTitle.x,y:pTitle.y}};","description":"Fix text wrapping inside button and field instances, Welcome overlap and Portfolio title position","fileKey":"qeLSUsUZzxgdj23JDXIOJ0"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7550,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":115463,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7550}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"c3bb3745-2563-48a6-8456-0b9a049e3a00","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:31:41.202Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015LqfmrCc5jL8kTtfAC7ATF","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015LqfmrCc5jL8kTtfAC7ATF","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"fixed\":14,\"wlTitle\":{\"x\":24,\"y\":418,\"w\":327,\"h\":36},\"pTitle\":{\"x\":68,\"y\":64}}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"ad7941ee-29d1-458f-a1c5-930ae993618f","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:31:46.176Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"fixed\":14,\"wlTitle\":{\"x\":24,\"y\":418,\"w\":327,\"h\":36},\"pTitle\":{\"x\":68,\"y\":64}}"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"3f759bb6-a41b-4ae7-bed6-176438235aeb"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015LqfmrCc5jL8kTtfAC7ATF","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgJwF99WoRlidplqwnNVR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01x2HzfbuRNzJMv1xtFQPRpK","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const ws=figma.root.children.find(p=>p.name.indexOf('03')===0); await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst frame = name => ws.children.find(n=>n.name===name && n.type==='FRAME');\nconst F = { splash:frame('01_Splash'), onb:frame('02_Onboarding'), empty:frame('03_Sign_Up_Empty'), filled:frame('03_Sign_Up_Filled'), phone:frame('04_Verify_Phone'), code:frame('05_Verify_Code'), welcome:frame('06_Welcome'), home:frame('07_Home'), port:frame('08_Portfolio'), detail:frame('09_Stock_Detail'), order:frame('10_Confirm_Order'), profile:frame('11_Profile') };\nconst missing = Object.keys(F).filter(k=>!F[k]);\nif (missing.length) throw new Error('missing frames '+missing.join(','));\n\nconst NAV = {type:'NODE', navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:{type:'DISSOLVE', duration:0.28, easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'}}};\nconst link = (node, dest, trigger) => { if(!node||!dest) return false; node.reactions=[{trigger: trigger||{type:'ON_CLICK'}, action: Object.assign({destinationId:dest.id}, NAV)}]; return true; };\nconst findInst = (parent, nm) => parent.findOne(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE' && n.name===nm);\nconst btn = (parent,label) => parent.findOne(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE' && n.name==='C/Button' && n.findAll(t=>t.type==='TEXT').some(t=>t.characters===label));\nconst tab = (parent,label) => parent.findAll(n=>n.type==='FRAME' && n.name==='Tab '+label)[0];\nconst textNode = (parent,label) => parent.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT').find(t=>t.characters===label);\n\nlet done=[];\nconst mark=(k,ok)=>{ if(ok) done.push(k); };\n\n// 01 Splash -> 02 after delay\nmark('splash→onboarding', link(F.splash, F.onb, {type:'AFTER_TIMEOUT', timeout:1.8}));\n\n// 02 Onboarding\nmark('onb Sign up', link(btn(F.onb,'Sign up'), F.empty));\nmark('onb Skip', link(textNode(F.onb,'Skip'), F.empty));\nmark('onb Sign in', link(btn(F.onb,'Sign in'), F.empty));\n\n// 03 Filled -> 04\nmark('filled Continue', link(btn(F.filled,'Continue'), F.phone));\n\n// 04 -> back to filled, send code -> 05\nconst backIn = f => f.children.find(c=>c.name==='Back');\nmark('04 back', link(backIn(F.phone), F.filled));\nmark('04 Send code', link(btn(F.phone,'Send code'), F.code));\n\n// 05 -> back to 04, verify -> 06\nmark('05 back', link(backIn(F.code), F.phone));\nmark('05 Verify', link(btn(F.code,'Verify account'), F.welcome));\n\n// 06 -> 07\nmark('06 ready', link(btn(F.welcome,'I’m ready to start!'), F.home));\n\n// tab wiring helper\nconst wireTabs = (f, map, prefix) => {\n  Object.keys(map).forEach(label=>{\n    const t = tab(f,label);\n    if(t && map[label]) mark(prefix+' tab '+label, link(t, map[label]));\n  });\n};\nconst navMap = {Home:F.home, Portfolio:F.port, Trade:F.order, Profile:F.profile};\nwireTabs(F.home, navMap, '07');\nwireTabs(F.port, navMap, '08');\nwireTabs(F.profile, navMap, '11');\n\n// 07: portfolio card -> 08, NFLX row -> 09\nconst card = F.home.children.find(c=>c.name==='Portfolio card');\nmark('07 card→08', link(card, F.port));\nconst nflxRow = F.home.children.find(c=>c.name==='Row NFLX');\nmark('07 NFLX→09', link(nflxRow, F.detail));\n\n// 08: back -> 07, NFLX row -> 09\nmark('08 back', link(backIn(F.port), F.home));\nconst pRow = F.port.children.find(c=>c.name==='Row NFLX');\nmark('08 NFLX→09', link(pRow, F.detail));\n\n// 09: back -> 07, Buy stocks -> 10\nmark('09 back', link(backIn(F.detail), F.home));\nmark('09 buy', link(btn(F.detail,'Buy stocks'), F.order));\n\n// 10: back -> 09, confirm -> 07\nmark('10 back', link(backIn(F.order), F.detail));\nmark('10 confirm', link(btn(F.order,'Confirm order'), F.home));\n\n// flow starting point\nws.flowStartingPoints = [{nodeId: F.splash.id, name:'StockWave · onboarding to order'}];\n\nreturn {done, total:done.length, flow:ws.flowStartingPoints};","description":"Wire prototype interactions between all 12 frames and set flow starting point","fileKey":"qeLSUsUZzxgdj23JDXIOJ0"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7550,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":115463,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7550}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"0560df35-5a68-4416-85b2-0f991faef350","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:31:53.983Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01x2HzfbuRNzJMv1xtFQPRpK","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
