ately inert and Trade entering Confirm Order as the brief specifies.\n\n**States covered:** empty vs filled sign-up with a disabled vs enabled Continue, partial code entry (first digit 2, focused second box), up and down trends, gain vs loss coloring, unchosen payment methods, and the current tab and range highlights.\n\n**Known limitations:** the three long screens (Home, Portfolio, Stock Detail) are built taller than 812 so all required content is visible; I did not add in-canvas scroll behavior to them. Entry-only items from the brief (Sign in, notifications, show/hide value, wishlist add, price alert, Summary and Financials tabs, ranges, Stockup, profile entries) are rendered as designed but have no destination screens, per the brief's instruction not to add frames beyond the 12."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":825,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":149674,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":825}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0864a141-9068-4bed-b915-f3abb7ade1bf","uuid":"fb7a3f69-7e78-4d7d-90dc-564b1ef43168","timestamp":"2026-10-30T19:36:37.852Z"}
